    {
      "position": 3,
      "section": "App I’m exploring —",
      "category": "other",
      "title": "Zero Fasting App",
      "creator": null,
      "note": "[Kevin Rose](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/zlue04m77unh0z8l9sq/x0hph6h7gw74gd/aHR0cHM6Ly90aW0uYmxvZy8yMDIwLzA0LzI5L3JhbmRvbS1zaG93LWJvb3p5LXF1YXJhbnRpbmUtZWRpdGlvbi8_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1jb252ZXJ0a2l0JnV0bV9tZWRpdW09Y29udmVydGtpdCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249NWJm) ([@KevinRose](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/zlue04m77unh0z8l9sq/dpheh0h730723m/aHR0cDovL3R3aXR0ZXIuY29tL0tldmluUm9zZQ==)) originally created Zero in 2016, and it is now the most popular fasting app in the world. It has millions of downloads and 4.9 out of 5 stars on the Apple App Store with 268,000+ ratings. [Dr. Peter Attia](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/zlue04m77unh0z8l9sq/e0hph7hnx0ndxn/aHR0cHM6Ly90aW0uYmxvZy8yMDE5LzExLzI3L3BldGVyLWF0dGlhLWZhc3RpbmctbWV0Zm9ybWluZy1sb25nZXZpdHkvP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9Y29udmVydGtpdCZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWNvbnZlcnRraXQmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPTViZg==) ([@PeterAttiaMD](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/zlue04m77unh0z8l9sq/7qh7h8h4go4xg0/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaW5zdGFncmFtLmNvbS9wZXRlcmF0dGlhbWQv)), one of my go-to doctors for anything performance- or longevity-related, is co-founder and chief medical officer. He is the person I call for fasting advice, and now Zero gives access to that same advice. For a short sample Q&A on fasting with Peter, [click here](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/zlue04m77unh0z8l9sq/owhkhqh8zr80zr/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuemVyb2Zhc3RpbmcuY29tL2Fzay16ZXJvLXdpdGgtZHItcGV0ZXItYXR0aWEv). They recently released [Zero Plus](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/zlue04m77unh0z8l9sq/z2hghnhdg3dmge/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuemVyb2Zhc3RpbmcuY29tL3plcm8tcGx1cw==), an upgrade for power users that I’m now using: “Your personal fasting coach, Zero Plus, is complete with expert resources and custom fasting plans that evolve with you over time—you’ll be equipped with knowledge and motivation to stay on the fast track.” You can download and test the app here: [iOS](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/zlue04m77unh0z8l9sq/p8heh9h7vz7pvg/aHR0cHM6Ly9hcHBzLmFwcGxlLmNvbS9hcHAvaWQxMTY4MzQ4NTQy), [Android](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/zlue04m77unh0z8l9sq/kkhmh6h97l9o7z/aHR0cHM6Ly9wbGF5Lmdvb2dsZS5jb20vc3RvcmUvYXBwcy9kZXRhaWxzP2lkPWNvbS56ZXJvZmFzdGluZy56ZXJv).",
